1
00:00:00,208 --> 00:00:00,791
Master?

2
00:00:01,208 --> 00:00:01,708
You?

3
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,708
Don’t make me laugh, psycho!

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
I’m the one holding my wedding here.

5
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:08,458
I chose this cathedral.

6
00:00:09,083 --> 00:00:10,291
Who else would it be?

7
00:00:11,166 --> 00:00:12,750
Hahaha!

8
00:00:13,875 --> 00:00:15,916
Who the hell do you think you are?

9
00:00:16,416 --> 00:00:19,500
Everyone knows Lord Redmond is the only heir.

10
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,083
You're just a dumped, broke loser!

11
00:00:25,541 --> 00:00:27,541
Stop wasting breath on this trash.

12
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:30,666
Throw him in the dungeons.

13
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:35,250
Jack, they’re attacking Severin!

14
00:00:37,291 --> 00:00:39,708
I'll take these tin cans down with me!

15
00:00:40,791 --> 00:00:41,916
We may be lowborn,

16
00:00:42,083 --> 00:00:44,291
but we won’t just stand here and take this!

17
00:00:44,333 --> 00:00:45,833
You filthy lowborns!

18
00:00:46,291 --> 00:00:48,125
You dare to challenge me?

19
00:00:48,125 --> 00:00:50,250
You stole his title,

20
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,791
you stole his wife,

21
00:00:51,791 --> 00:00:54,333
and now you want to butcher him in a church?!

22
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,083
There is no freaking justice in Golantis!

23
00:00:58,625 --> 00:00:59,208
Justice?

24
00:01:00,083 --> 00:01:00,791
For slaves?

25
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:04,083
If you're so eager to die for this loser,

26
00:01:04,083 --> 00:01:06,000
I'll send you all to hell together!

27
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,708
I’ll call the Black Market Blades right now to butcher you all!

28
00:01:13,416 --> 00:01:14,166
Blade Master!

29
00:01:15,208 --> 00:01:17,958
Get to the Holy Cathedral and butcher them all!

30
00:01:22,541 --> 00:01:23,541
You’re all dead.

31
00:01:24,708 --> 00:01:26,291
The Blade Master are coming.
